 "description": "<p>Hotel Qaqortoq offers comfortable accommodation with an authentic Greenlandic atmosphere that is warm and inviting. There are works of art made by local artists throughout the hotel.&nbsp;Perched on a hill overlooking the harbor, Hotel Qaqortoq is an oasis of calm in this bustling town, a &quot;home away from home&quot; and the perfect place to meet with friends&nbsp;or business associates for drinks and a relaxed dinner.&nbsp;Hotel Qaqortoq is also a natural choice for courses and conferences, with the latest multimedia, Internet and audio-visual conference equipment.</p>",
